# SI units, from the BIPM SI Brochure, 9th edition (2019), with the non-SI units accepted for use with the SI.
# All definitions are exact except the dalton: CODATA 2018 value, approximate, written as an exact decimal literal.
# Format: symbol:name formula [Type]; '~' defines an alternate unit, '!' a base unit; '#' starts a comment.

@system SI

# Base units
m:metre !L
kg:kilogram !M
s:second !T
A:ampere !I
K:kelvin !Θ
mol:mole !N
cd:candela !J

# Alternate units (distinct atoms with the same dimension as their formula)
rad:radian ~ [Angle]
sr:steradian ~ [SolidAngle]
Hz:hertz ~ 1/s [Frequency]
Bq:becquerel ~ 1/s [Radioactivity]

# Derived units with special names
N:newton kg m / s^2 [Force]
Pa:pascal N / m^2 [Pressure]
J:joule N m [Energy]
W:watt J / s [Power]
C:coulomb A s [ElectricCharge]
V:volt W / A [ElectricPotential]
F:farad C / V [ElectricCapacitance]
Ω:ohm V / A [ElectricResistance]
S:siemens A / V [ElectricConductance]
Wb:weber V s [MagneticFlux]
T:tesla Wb / m^2 [MagneticFluxDensity]
H:henry Wb / A [ElectricInductance]
lm:lumen cd sr [LuminousFlux]
lx:lux lm / m^2 [Illuminance]
kat:katal mol / s [CatalyticActivity]
Gy:gray ~ J / kg [RadiationDoseAbsorbed]
Sv:sievert ~ J / kg [RadiationDoseEffective]
°C:degree_Celsius K = x + 273.15 [Temperature]
m²:square_metre m^2 [Area]
m³:cubic_metre m^3 [Volume]
g:gram 1|1000 kg [Mass]

# Non-SI units accepted for use with the SI
min:minute 60 s
h:hour 3600 s
d:day 86400 s
ha:hectare 10000 m^2
L:litre 1|1000 m^3
t:tonne 1000 kg
eV:electronvolt 1.602176634e-19 J
Da:dalton 1.66053906660e-27 kg
au:astronomical_unit 149597870700 m
deg:degree pi|180 rad
arcmin:arcminute pi|10800 rad
arcsec:arcsecond pi|648000 rad

# Prefixed units generated as constants; other metric prefixes resolve at run time
@prefixed m k c m µ n p
@prefixed g m µ
@prefixed s m µ n p
@prefixed A m µ
@prefixed K m µ n
@prefixed cd m k
@prefixed mol m
@prefixed kat m µ n k
@prefixed Hz k M G T
@prefixed N k m
@prefixed Pa h k M G
@prefixed J k M G m
@prefixed W k M G m
@prefixed C m µ
@prefixed V k m µ
@prefixed F m µ n p
@prefixed Ω k M
@prefixed S m
@prefixed Wb m
@prefixed T m µ n
@prefixed H m µ n
@prefixed eV k M G T
@prefixed L m c d
@prefixed Bq k M G
@prefixed Gy m
@prefixed Sv m µ
@prefixed rad m
@prefixed lx k
@prefixed lm m k
@prefixed sr m
@prefixed Da k M
@prefixed t k M G
